{"id":"n63311-2-7","stage":4,"title":"섬기다 · 侍奉","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n63311-2-7-1","ko":"왜 나무 앞에서 인사를 하세요?","zh":"您为什么向树行礼？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"나무","meaning":"树，树木","explanation":"나무：树，树木。","readings":[{"term":"나무","audio":"/audio/b294b251f77dfbc5ede4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32750","senseId":"1","lemma":"나무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나무","audio":"/audio/b294b251f77dfbc5ede4.mp3"}},{"text":"앞에서","meaning":"前面","explanation":"앞：前面；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"7","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앞에서","audio":"/audio/f32ce1c6132ddf4cbe9d.mp3"}},{"text":"인사를","meaning":"问候，打招呼","explanation":"인사：问候，打招呼；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"인사","audio":"/audio/ae353e9482abc103f0f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66311","senseId":"1","lemma":"인사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"인사를","audio":"/audio/79a063d27a29b9e39195.mp3"}},{"text":"하세요?","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하세요","audio":"/audio/20c70a963b62c0806108.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"b294b251f77dfbc5","term":"나무","zh":"树，树木","audio":"/audio/b294b